  "question": {
    "text": "A transistor is connected in common emitter circuit configuration, the collector supply voltage is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;and the voltage drop across a resistor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> in the collector circuit is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the current gain factor&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>24</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the base current is ____<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;A</mi></math>.&nbsp;(Round off to the Nearest Integer)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p>",
